               <code>
                  <coding>
                     <system value="http://loinc.org"/>
                     <code value="8648-8"/>
                     <display value="Hospital course note"/>
                  </coding>
               </code>
               <text>
                  <status value="generated"/>
                  <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Dear colleague, I am writing to inform you about the hospital course of your patient, a 20-year-old male admitted on 21/06/2020 with acute right lower quadrant abdominal pain, nausea, and low-grade fever. Clinical examination revealed rebound tenderness at McBurney's point. Blood tests demonstrated elevated inflammatory markers with leukocytosis. Abdominal ultrasound confirmed the diagnosis of acute appendicitis. The patient was adequately rehydrated with intravenous fluids and received analgesic and antibiotic therapy. On 22/06/2020, a laparoscopic emergency appendectomy was successfully performed without intraoperative complications. The postoperative course was uneventful. Wound care was provided, and vital signs remained stable throughout. The patient was mobilized early with physiotherapy support and discharged home on 23/06/2020 in good general condition. Please arrange follow-up in approximately two weeks. Antibiotic oral therapy is to be continued for five days post-discharge. Yours sincerely.</div>
               </text>
            </section>
